  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Stintaril</defName>
    <label>stintaril</label>
    <description>The stintarils were a species of rapacious arboreal rodents native to the moon Yavin 4. They were predators and their prey mainly consisted of woolamanders and whisper birds, but could and would hunt other small to medium sized creatures. The metabolism of the stintaril was extremely high, and they had to eat often. It's very likely these voracious predators were introduced and established themselves as a form of pest control on several worlds.</description>
